BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 494 Td (A good one to one is the most useful management tool you have. Keep it weekly and keep) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 479 Td (it regular, even when it is short. Make it about the other person, not a status update) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 464 Td (for you. Start by asking what they would like to talk about, then cover what is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 449 Td (blocking them, what they are proud of, and what support they need. The aim is to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 434 Td (surface problems early, while they are still small. If you cancel one to ones when you) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 419 Td (are busy, people learn that they come second, and they stop bringing you the early) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 404 Td (warnings.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 389 Td () Tj ET
