BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 273 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 258 Td (Here is a structure you can use straight away. Begin with a short check in, how are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 243 Td (things, really. Then cover their topics first, followed by yours. Ask open questions) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 228 Td (such as, what would make this week easier. Before you finish, agree on actions, who) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 213 Td (will do what by when, and write them down so you can start the next meeting by) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 198 Td (reviewing them. Keep notes brief and keep them private. Over a few weeks the pattern) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 183 Td (builds trust, because people can see that what they say leads to something happening.) Tj ET
