BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 670 Td (- Agree check-ins before you hand over) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 655 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 640 Td (Delegation does not mean throwing a task over the wall. Match the level of support to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 625 Td (the person and the task. Someone new to a task needs more guidance than someone who) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 610 Td (has done it five times. Share the outcome you want and the reason it matters, not only) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 595 Td (the steps. And agree check-ins before you hand anything over, so that you stay) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 580 Td (informed without hovering. Delegating and disappearing leaves people stuck. Delegating) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 565 Td (and hovering takes the ownership back. The middle path is clear expectations, agreed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 550 Td (checkpoints, and trust between them.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 535 Td () Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 0.094 0.094 0.106 rg 56 514 Td (Feedback that lands) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 494 Td (- Describe the behaviour) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 479 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 464 Td (- Explain its impact) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 449 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 434 Td (- Say what you would like instead, then listen) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 419 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 404 Td (Feedback works best when it is specific and timely. Describe the behaviour you saw,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 389 Td (without judging the person. Explain the impact it had on the team or the result. Say) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 374 Td (what you would like to see instead. Then stop talking and listen, because the other) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 359 Td (person may know something you do not. Give positive feedback with the same care, since) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 344 Td (people repeat what they are told works. Do not save feedback for the annual review. A) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 329 Td (small comment given the same week is easier to hear and easier to act on than a large) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 314 Td (one given months later.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 299 Td () Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 0.094 0.094 0.106 rg 56 278 Td (Common mistakes in the first year) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 258 Td (- Avoiding the hard conversation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 243 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 228 Td (- Treating everyone the same way) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 213 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 198 Td (- Forgetting to ask for feedback yourself) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 183 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 168 Td (Three mistakes appear again and again. The first is avoiding the hard conversation,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 153 Td (hoping it will fix itself. It rarely does, and the problem usually grows. The second) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 138 Td (is treating everyone the same, when people need different levels of support and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 123 Td (different ways of hearing feedback. The third is forgetting to ask for feedback) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 108 Td (yourself. Ask your team what you could do differently, and then actually do something) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 93 Td (with the answer. Being willing to hear it models the behaviour you want from them, and) Tj ET
